Description: System-wide ad, tracker and popup blocking for iOS
 MYbloXX® by MYXXdev™ blocks ads and trackers across your iPhone with a local
 proxy. Add your own rules, protect supported browsers from popups and redirects
 with Shield, remove ads inside supported apps, and choose which apps run
 without blocking with App Control. Everything runs on this iPhone, and the
 built-in rules update automatically. For iOS 15 and later with RootHide.
